[{"code":"prerender_impure","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":40,"col":48},"end":{"line":40,"col":53}},"title":"IMPURE PRERENDERED PROGRAM","message":"This program prerenders, so its `init` must be pure, and this may have an\neffect: it may read or change something outside the program. The build computes\nthe page from `init`, and the browser computes the same first render from it\nagain, so a read of the host, the clock or randomness could make the two differ\n(`docs/design/prerender.md` §3.1). Make the call where an effect may run — in a\ncommand, after the first render — or leave it out."}]
